Provers
-------

Vampire 5.0.1, built from source at commit 1b13eaf, one problem at a time:
every problem with --mode casc at 300 s and, for a Satisfiable full form
casc did not solve, --mode casc_sat at 300 s. The repository also decides
every pair with Z3 4.8.12 on an SMT-LIB encoding of the same statements;
that encoding is not part of this export.

    version  problems  Satisfiable  Unsatisfiable  solved    slowest
    1             111           71             40     111     1.04 s
    2              86           57             29      86    22.12 s
    3               2            1              1       2     1.47 s

The full forms: 88 solved with --mode casc; 0 not solved within the limit.

The slowest full forms:

    KGC092+2   KGC388-1   Satisfiable     casc         22.1 s
    KGC091+2   KGC383-2   Unsatisfiable   casc          5.3 s
    KGC086+2   KGC380-1   Satisfiable     casc          1.5 s
    KGC090+2   KGC383-1   Satisfiable     casc          1.5 s
    KGC088+3   KGC391-1   Satisfiable     casc          1.5 s
    KGC037+2   KGC331-1   Satisfiable     casc          1.5 s
    KGC039+2   KGC333-1   Satisfiable     casc          1.5 s
    KGC088+2   KGC382-1   Satisfiable     casc          1.5 s
    KGC087+2   KGC380-2   Unsatisfiable   casc          0.8 s
    KGC040+2   KGC333-2   Satisfiable     casc          0.5 s

Each of the 8 axiom files alone: 8 Satisfiable, with --mode casc.

Every file parses with tptp4X -x -w, includes expanded, with no warning.
tptp4X was built from the TPTP World sources (github.com/TPTPWorld/TPTP4X
at ce83fd4, JJParser at 94a781a).

Layout
------

    Problems/KGC/KGCnnn+1.p    version 1
    Problems/KGC/KGCnnn+2.p    version 2
    Problems/KGC/KGCnnn+3.p    version 3, where it is written
    Axioms/KGC000+0.ax         the order axioms
    Axioms/KGC000+1.ax ...     one file per vocabulary
    manifest.csv               one row per problem: problem, version,
                               original name, case, check, status,
                               case verdict, axiom files, Vampire
                               result, mode, time; a merged problem
                               has its checks in one field, by spaces

Includes are written include('Axioms/KGC000+N.ax'), relative to this
folder.

